    comment "en" """
        Source V3098 = Swedish extension of V30.9 (unspecified occupant, traffic accident, three-wheeled
        MV collision with pedestrian/animal) + activity suffix SNOMED CT 214031005 407153006 (other
        specified activities). Athena crosswalk V30.9 -> 437165 and 443539 verified. Activity-context
        suffix is a Swedish national extension axis with no separate SNOMED CT representation; the SNOMED CT
        targets fully subsume the accident/injury axis. broader: target subsumes source. tier: one-level
        broader with verified crosswalk.
        """
}
